---
title: Blog
locale: "es"
description: Blogs y Microblogs de cualquier tema
layout: layouts/base.html
---

Blogs, MicroBlogs, Entradas, etc. Como tu quieras llamarlo, acá realmente hay cualquier tipo de cosa que se me pasa por la cabeza y me gustaría dejarlo en un lugar para que quede guardado y en publico.

<div>
{% set allTags = collections.blog_es | uniqueTags %}

<div class="filter-bar">
  <input type="text" id="search-input" class="search-input" placeholder="Buscar...">
	
  <div class="tag-filters">
    <button class="tag-filter-btn active" data-tag="all">Todos</button>
    {% for tag in allTags %}
    <button class="tag-filter-btn" data-tag="{{ tag }}">{{ tag }}</button>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</div>

<div class="post-list">
{% for post in collections.blog_es %}
  <div class="post-card" data-title="{{ post.data.title | lower }}" data-description="{{ post.data.description | lower }}" data-tags="{{ post.data.tags | join(' ') }}">
    <span class="post-card-title">
      <a class="post-card-link" href="{{ post.url | url }}"> {{ post.data.title }} </a>
      <span class="post-card-date">{{ post.data.date | readableDate }}</span>
    </span>
    <p class="post-card-description">{{ post.data.description }}</p>
    <div class="post-tags">
      {% for tag in post.data.tags %}
      <span class="post-tag">{{ tag }}</span>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
{% endfor %}
</div>

<script src="/content/media/post-filter.js" defer></script>
</div>